  "prefLabel": "Geo 403.04 Reinstatement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 403.04 Reinstatement. In addition to the requirements set forth in Geo 401.05, an applicant for reinstatement shall obtain 12 additional hours of continuing education activity for a total of 36. Additional hours shall be for the current reinstatement period only, none shall be carried over into the licensee’s subsequent biennial renewal period.\n\nSource. #7526, eff 7-1-01; ss #9439, eff 3-25-09; ss by #12152, eff 3-24-17",
